The Tararua valleys are a magical place. Following the wild rivers- Mangatainoka, Ruamāhanga, Waingawa, Atiwhakatū, Waiohine, Tauwharenīkau delivered the goodness in an epic day out.

I couldn't have done this without those who inspired and have contributed to the SK story, and in that regard herewith be my write-up...

